      "comment": "PENNY DAZE (1) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors three starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (24.10) at this track over 407m. Key chance in this line up. ZIPPING OLSEN (2) has missed the frame at her last two but did run well three back when second (23.92) in a Grade 4 at this track. Can feature with the right run. ROCKY RIDE (5) has been on speed at the last couple here and fought on to hit the frame, last start finishing third beaten 2.25 lengths (24.21). Overdue and is among the main hopes. CUSTODY (4) was out of the frame here most recently but can atone.",
